        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/38cc1eb901379894badb2646f37e7c88.poster.avif?t=1765674006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/38cc1eb901379894badb2646f37e7c88.webm?t=1765674006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/38cc1eb901379894badb2646f37e7c88.mp4?t=1765674006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this exciting retro adventure, RobsyBot navigates a pixelated maze filled with traps, flashing panels, and secret doors. Each level feels like a digital labyrinth where every corner hides dangers and discoveries, evoking the spirit of classic 8-bit arcade games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/1819c7d5211505d4488f753bfe3fd76e.poster.avif?t=1765674006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/1819c7d5211505d4488f753bfe3fd76e.webm?t=1765674006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/1819c7d5211505d4488f753bfe3fd76e.mp4?t=1765674006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player must explore carefully, collecting keys that unlock new paths and controlling their firing rate. The game's fixed-screen burst mechanics immerse the player in frantic combat where precision and timing are everything. RobsyBot advances and fires while dodging waves of prehistoric enemies: from agile velociraptors to enormous nuclear tyrannosaurs. Each enemy has its own rhythm, demanding strategic movements within the arena's confined space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/8e0a66650ccc36dd3c0eee0413067169.poster.avif?t=1765674006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/8e0a66650ccc36dd3c0eee0413067169.webm?t=1765674006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/8e0a66650ccc36dd3c0eee0413067169.mp4?t=1765674006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What truly defines the experience is its nostalgic essence: bright pixels, chiptune soundtracks, and a sense of endless replayability. Every victory feels well-deserved, every defeat motivates you to master the maze a little more. RobsyBot is not just a game, it's a tribute to the golden age of arcades, reimagined through pure retro mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/d4bf8b5ca6bc1609ac2f3e9c1ed2af55.avif?t=1765674006\" width=600 height=864 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/38cc1eb901379894badb2646f37e7c88.poster.avif?t=1765674006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/38cc1eb901379894badb2646f37e7c88.webm?t=1765674006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/38cc1eb901379894badb2646f37e7c88.mp4?t=1765674006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this exciting retro adventure, RobsyBot navigates a pixelated maze filled with traps, flashing panels, and secret doors. Each level feels like a digital labyrinth where every corner hides dangers and discoveries, evoking the spirit of classic 8-bit arcade games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/1819c7d5211505d4488f753bfe3fd76e.poster.avif?t=1765674006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/1819c7d5211505d4488f753bfe3fd76e.webm?t=1765674006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/1819c7d5211505d4488f753bfe3fd76e.mp4?t=1765674006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player must explore carefully, collecting keys that unlock new paths and controlling their firing rate. The game's fixed-screen burst mechanics immerse the player in frantic combat where precision and timing are everything. RobsyBot advances and fires while dodging waves of prehistoric enemies: from agile velociraptors to enormous nuclear tyrannosaurs. Each enemy has its own rhythm, demanding strategic movements within the arena's confined space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/8e0a66650ccc36dd3c0eee0413067169.poster.avif?t=1765674006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/8e0a66650ccc36dd3c0eee0413067169.webm?t=1765674006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/8e0a66650ccc36dd3c0eee0413067169.mp4?t=1765674006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What truly defines the experience is its nostalgic essence: bright pixels, chiptune soundtracks, and a sense of endless replayability. Every victory feels well-deserved, every defeat motivates you to master the maze a little more. RobsyBot is not just a game, it's a tribute to the golden age of arcades, reimagined through pure retro mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976820/extras/d4bf8b5ca6bc1609ac2f3e9c1ed2af55.avif?t=1765674006\" width=600 height=864 /></span></p>",
